                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px">
</p><p style="text-indent:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">各位老师：</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">为贯彻落实《浙江省教育信息化</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“十</span>四<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">五”发展规划》</span>《绍兴市教育信息化十四五发展计划》精神，加强我市中小学教师积极开展信息化教育教学实践与研究，提升广大教师的信息素养和科研能力，促进技术与教育教学的深度融合，现就<span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年全</span>市教育技术（信息化）课题申报工作及省教育技术（信息化）课题选送工作通知如下。请有意申报的老师准备以下材料：每个课题(申报表电子稿、汇总表、课题方案)单独一个文件夹，名称以推荐序号+论文名称命名，于</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman";">2025</span>年<span style="font-family: "Times New Roman";">4</span>月<span style="font-family: "Times New Roman";">1</span>日</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">前汇总后上报至教科室，逾期不候。上述纸质材料也同步上交。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">一、课题申报类别</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（一）重点课题（周期为</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">2</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">年）</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（二）专项课题（周期为</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">1</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">年）</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（三）教育装备与实验教学单列课题（周期为</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年）</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">二、课题申报条件</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（一）重点课题：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">重点课题</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">是</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">指在已有研究基础上需要继续深入研究的，在信息化建设与发展领域具有重大理论和应用价值的课题。全</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">市</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">从事基础教育信息化实践或研究工作的单位和个人，均可申报。如承担过省</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（市）</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">教育信息化研究专项、单列或认定性课题，开展相关研究并已经结题的，同等情况下优先立项。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（二）专项课题：全</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">市</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">从事基础教育信息化实践或研究工作的单位和个人均可申报。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（三）教育装备与实验教学单列课题：从事中小学教育装备建设与管理、专业场馆（综合实践基地、学习空间、学科教室等）建设与应用、学科实验教学（含信息技术学科）研究的单位和个人均可申报。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（四）各类别课题限额为独立分配，不满限额视为自动放弃，类别间的课题名额不作调剂。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">五</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">）有以下情况之一者，不予受理：</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">申报人不是课题主持人或不承担实质性研究任务的；</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">课题的申报人（负责人）为</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">人以上的、</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">人同时申报两项或两项以上的；</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">3</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">.</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">正在承担省</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（市）</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">教育信息化研究课题而未结题的；</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">4</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">.</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">申报省级课题的：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">同一课题已在其他厅级及以上课题中立项的</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">；申报市级课题的：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">同一课题已在其他</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">市</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">级及以上课题中立项的；</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">三、课题申报</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:楷体;font-size:21px">（一）</span><span style=";font-family:楷体;font-size:21px">推荐形式</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">由</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">各区、县（市）教育</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">信息化课题管理部门汇总区域内申报课题，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">根据申报分配数</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">择优</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">上报至市教育技术中心。市直学校</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">直接</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">报</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">送至</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">市教育技术中心。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:楷体;font-size:21px">（二）课题申报分配数</span><span style=";font-family:楷体;font-size:21px">（个）</span></p><table width="593" style="width: 556px;"><tbody><tr style="height:20px" class="firstRow"><td width="78" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style=";text-auto