5, 255);"><p style=";text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;line-height:35px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px">14</span></p></td><td width="71" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style=";text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;line-height:35px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px">12</span></p></td><td width="98" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style=";text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;line-height:35px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px">4</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">绍兴市首批中小学智慧校园标杆学校、绍兴市中小学智慧校园标杆学校建设校（第一、二批</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">、</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">三批</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">)、绍兴市中小学iTech人工智能试点校可单独报送1个，不占原有名额。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">各类别课题限额为独立分配，不满限额视为自动放弃，类别间的课题名额不作调剂。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">市教育局组织专家对各</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">地</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">和市直学校报送的申报项目进行评审，确定市级立项课题，并从中遴选部分优秀项目申报省级课题</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:楷体;font-size:21px">（三）</span><span style=";font-family:楷体;font-size:21px">报送材料包括</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">1.</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">《课题申报汇总表》</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">(详见附件</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">1</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">，纸质稿</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">2</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">份，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">Word</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">稿</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">1</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">份</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">，纸质稿加盖公章）。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">2.</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">《课题申报、评审表》（详见附件</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">2</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">，纸质稿</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">2</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">份，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">Word</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">稿</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">1</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">份，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">评审表含</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“申请者的承诺与成果使用授权”，需申报人亲笔签名。）</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">3.</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">《</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">课题方案》（与《课题申报、评审表》分开，纸质稿</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">2</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">份，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">Word</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">稿</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">1</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">份，该</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">部分内容不能出现课题负责人、所在单位、课题组成员和地区等具体信息。）</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">4.</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">要求</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">将上述</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">材料</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">放在同一个文件夹内，并按照</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">课题名称</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">”命名，文件夹内的</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">材料名称严格按照</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“《</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">课题</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">申报</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">汇总表</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">》《</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">课题申报、评审表</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">》</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">、</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">《</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">课题方案</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">》</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">”命名。</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">要求</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">上报材料的</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">Word</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">稿</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（签名除外），与纸质</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">稿</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">完全一致。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">备注：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">1.</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">由于</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">省级</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">信息化</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">课题</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">由</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">市级</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">择优选送，故填写的评审表、汇总表采用省级文件格式。</span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">2.</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">《</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">课题方</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">案》</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">将进行学术不端的检测（去除个人发表复制比不超过</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">30</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">％），请将字数控制在</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5000</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">字内，否则可能影响检测</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">，格式要求为</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">Word</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">稿</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">3.</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">课题组成员名单及职能分工以汇总表盖章件信息为准，课题组其他成员人数不能超过</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">5</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">人，课题研究开展过程中原则上人员分工等不再进行调整。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:楷体;font-size:21px">（四）</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">报送方式与时间</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">每个课题</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">(</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">申报表电子稿、汇总表、</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">课题方案</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">)</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">单独</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">一个文件夹，名称以推荐序号</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">+</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">论文名称命名。各区、县（市）汇总后，按重点课题、专项课题、单列课题顺序分类，并设置单独文件夹，于</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">月</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">8</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">日</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">前汇总后上报至绍兴市教育技术中心，逾期不候。以</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">绍兴市首批中小学智慧校园标杆学校等奖励名额上报的材料也由各县市区汇总后一并上报。并在汇总表中备注</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“绍兴市首批中小学智慧校园标杆学校”等信息。</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">市直学校以校为单位直接发送。</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">上述纸质材料</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">于</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">月</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">8</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">日寄</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">至</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">绍兴市教育技术中心杨扬老师，地址：绍兴市越城区马臻路</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">89</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">号培训部</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">号楼</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">310</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">室，邮编：</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">312000</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。联系电话：</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">0575-</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">85730573</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">电子稿一律</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">发送至</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">87828418@qq.com</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">邮件主题以</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">“</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">课题名称</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">”</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">命名</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 21px">（五）</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 21px">未按以上要求报送的均为无效，不进入评审。</span></strong></p><p style="margin-left: 0;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">附件：</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1.</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">课题</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">申报</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">汇总表</span></p><p style="margin-left: 0;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_xls.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/2/202502281642548650.xls" title="202502281642548650.xls">202502281642548650.xls</a></p><p style="margin-left: 0;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px"><span style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 107px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2.</span></span><span style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 107px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">课题申报、评审表</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/2/202502281643137563.doc" title="202502281643137563.doc">202502281643137563.doc</a></p><p>
</p>
    
